//Instructions This exercise gives you more practice at simplifying information. You are given a passage of text. Your task is to simplify this into a telegram of 12 words. Remember, a telegram uses the fewest words possible to get the message across. You will be rated on how well you can do this. Remember to keep it simple, but the message must be clear.
//Ratings Before you begin, rate how well you predict you will do this exercise by selecting the number that applies. //Circling --> selecting 5 - I will have no problems in completing the whole task correctly. 4 - I will have a few mild problems but I will complete over ¾ of the task correctly. 3 - I will not complete the whole task but will do over ½ of it correctly. 2 - I will have some problems so that I can complete only a small part of the task. 1 - I will have major problems with this task.
//Activity Telegram Activity: Get Ready Telegram Activity: Exercise Simplify the following passage into a telegram. The telegram can be only 12 words long. Simplify the passage to 12 words: Today I woke up feeling rather ill and feverish. My chest is very congested and all my muscles ache. I simply could not get out of bed. The doctor came immediately and concluded that I have contracted the flu. He insists that I stay in bed for a few days to avoid complications. But even without his urgings I am not able to do much with myself. So I am stuck. You must come immediately. I cannot complete these most important deals without your help.
Hello blank fragment
//Post Ratings Telegram Activity: Post Ratings Now that you have completed this exercise, rate how well you actually did by selecting the number that applies //After --> Now that, circling --> selecting 5 - I had no problems in completing the whole task correctly. 4 - I had a few mild problems but I completed over ¾ of the task correctly. 3 - I did not complete the whole task but did over ½ of it correctly. 2 - I had some problems so that I completed only a small part of the task. 1 - I had major problems with this task.
